    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45547" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">strātus</span></b> , ūs,
			m.
		sterno. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A spreading</i>, <i>strewing</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 50, 3</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, for the usual stratum, <i>a cover</i>, <i>spread</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in stratu omnem stragulam vestem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 50, 16, 45</span></i>
			; Favorin. ap. <i><span class="en">Gell. 15, 8, 2</span></i>.—Of <i>a horse-cloth</i>, <i><span class="en">Sol. 45
					<i>med.</i></span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
